<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs off $1.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs off $1.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were</p>
<p>$1.50 lower than Friday's close. Top $58.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3  230-260 lbs    56.50-58.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  260-270 lbs    55.50-56.50</p>
<p>	  270-280 lbs    54.50-55.50</p>
<p>Sows steady. Top 53.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-500 lbs    41.00-46.00</p>
<p>	 over 500 lbs    50.00-53.00</p>
</text>
